{{Navigation}}

* Use "[[Branded Fusion]] to send "[[Fallen of Albaz]]" and "[[The Light - Hex-Sealed Fusion]]" or "[[Goddess with the Third Eye]]", then this card's effect to banish both and summon "[[Red-Eyes Dark Dragoon]].
* When Summoning this card with "Branded Fusion", use "[[The Bystial Lubellion]]" as the LIGHT material, then "The Bystial Lubellion" can Special Summon itself from the [[Graveyard|GY]] by tributing this card.

== List ==
* [[Level]] 8 or lower [[Fusion Monster]]s that can be [[Fusion Summon]]ed, except "[[Albion the Branded Dragon]]":

{{Card query|[[Summoning::Can be Fusion Summoned]] [[Primary type::Fusion Monster]] [[Level::<8]] [[!Albion the Branded Dragon]] |medium=official}}
